# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setup {#setup}"
msgstr "セットアップ {#setup}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The helper module [`mpo_learning.jl`](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation/blob/main/docs/tutorials/assets/classical-shadows/julia/mpo_learning.jl), which the Setup cell downloads, implements the learner. The tutorial calls the following functions from it:\n"
msgstr "ヘルパーモジュール[`mpo_learning.jl`](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation/blob/main/docs/tutorials/assets/classical-shadows/julia/mpo_learning.jl)は、セットアップのセルでダウンロードされ、学習器を実装しています。このチュートリアルでは、このモジュールから次の関数を呼び出します。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Function | Purpose |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `kicked_ising_reference(N, D; depolarization)` | Exact MPO of the ideal kicked-Ising state, or of the state after local depolarizing noise |\n"
"| `split_settings(group; seed, train_fraction)` | Randomly assign measurement settings to training and testing sets (half each by default) |\n"
"| `training_marginals(train; ell, prior)` | Shadow estimates of every learning window, from the training settings only |\n"
"| `fitted_prior(ideal, train)` | Prior for common randomized measurements (CRM), fitted to the measured purity of each window, as in the paper |\n"
"| `learn_mpo(marginals, N; ell, maxbond, sweeps)` | Sweep the one-site update of the paper along the chain, starting from the maximally mixed state |\n"
"| `max_fidelity(a, b)`, `mpo_overlap(a, b)` | Exact $\\mathcal{F}_{\\max}$ and $\\mathrm{tr}(ab)$ between two MPOs |\n"
"| `afc_estimate`, `afc_statistics`, `afc_prefix_curve` | AFC estimates of $\\mathcal{F}_{\\max}$ and $S_2$ from the testing settings, with jackknife error bars |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 関数 | 目的 |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `kicked_ising_reference(N, D; depolarization)` | 理想的なキックト・イジング状態、または局所的な脱分極ノイズ後の状態の正確なMPO |\n"
"| `split_settings(group; seed, train_fraction)` | 測定設定を訓練セットとテストセットにランダムに割り当てる(デフォルトでは半分ずつ) |\n"
"| `training_marginals(train; ell, prior)` | 訓練設定のみからの、すべての学習ウィンドウのシャドウ推定値 |\n"
"| `fitted_prior(ideal, train)` | 共通ランダム化測定(CRM)の事前分布。論文と同様に、各ウィンドウの測定された純度にフィットさせたもの |\n"
"| `learn_mpo(marginals, N; ell, maxbond, sweeps)` | 最大混合状態から開始し、論文の1サイト更新を連鎖に沿ってスイープする |\n"
"| `max_fidelity(a, b)`, `mpo_overlap(a, b)` | 2つのMPO間の正確な$\\mathcal{F}_{\\max}$と$\\mathrm{tr}(ab)$ |\n"
"| `afc_estimate`, `afc_statistics`, `afc_prefix_curve` | テスト設定からの$\\mathcal{F}_{\\max}$と$S_2$のAFC推定値(ジャックナイフ誤差棒付き) |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The learner stores the MPO in the Pauli basis. This keeps the model Hermitian with unit trace, but it does not force the model to be positive semidefinite, so the notebook reports how negative its eigenvalues become.\n"
msgstr "学習器はMPOをパウリ基底で保持します。これによりモデルはエルミートでトレースが1になりますが、半正定値になることは強制されません。そのため、ノートブックでは固有値がどれだけ負になるかを報告します。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Small-scale simulator example {#small-scale-simulator-example}"
msgstr "小規模なシミュレーターの例 {#small-scale-simulator-example}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
